{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435450/extras/Steam_Header_Image__1_.png?t=1744217093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Azoove is a co-op card\u00a0roguelike about overcoming limited communication on an ill-fated save-the-world road trip to seal a cursed book.      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive together with online multiplayer, playing cards to <strong>manage resources</strong>, mitigating each day's new dangers (<strong>Misfortunes</strong>)<strong>\u00a0</strong>as you trek further through the Azoove desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During one phase of each round, communication with allies is limited to exchanging cards without revealing your hand. You must learn to trust in your teammates \u2014 or die trying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Enjoy two-player co-op now, with four-player support coming with the full release! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WILL YOU MAKE IT IN TIME? OR WILL YOU BE LOST TO THE SANDS OF AZOOVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435450/extras/DividerOpen.png?t=1744217093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435450/extras/nocoms.gif?t=1744217093\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Mechanic: Overcoming Limited Communications</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collaborate Silently!</strong>\u00a0As the Heroes fan out in search of <strong>Opportunity Cards</strong>, players are not allowed to discuss their hand. You must instead deduce the best move from what little planning and information you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exchange\u00a0Opportunity Cards</strong> strategically to share information and optimize the use of dwindling resources. Create unique communication patterns that help interpret the meaning behind traded cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The game will not</i>\u00a0force <i>silence on you. You are expected to be using your own communication software (such as Discord) and follow the rules (or don't\u00a0\u2014 we can't stop you but we promise it is more fun this way)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435450/extras/CooperationMeansSurvivalNew.gif?t=1744217093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435450/extras/DividerCenterVer2.png?t=1744217093\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet the heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as 4 heroes with their unique powers and cards:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Oriana, the\u00a0Ranger</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sage, the Forager</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Auri, the Bard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rin, the Guardian</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435450/extras/AllHeroes.png?t=1744217093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435450/extras/DividerCenterVer2.png?t=1744217093\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A lifetime past</strong>, Farloon's founder saved his people with a stolen book of secrets. Now, with his death, the payment comes due - the souls of your city. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only <strong>returning the grimoire</strong> to its rightful wardens may divert Farloon's fate - but a deadly desert lies between you and your city's salvation. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CAN YOU RETURN THE TOME IN TIME? HOW WILL YOU SURVIVE ARID AZOOVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435450/extras/BookAndSettingOutSteam.png?t=1744217093\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435450/extras/DividerCenterVer2.png?t=1744217093\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Replayability and Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tinker with <strong>Trinkets</strong>: items that grant passive abilities that strengthen and steer each expedition in exciting new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you overcome Azoove's normal challenges, add <strong>additional rules</strong> to complicate and <strong>challenge</strong> veteran players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435450/extras/DividerClose.png?t=1744217093\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sealed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435450/7aa08aeec65ffdd6ac3af986caeb8d5ef12521c8.jpg"},{"name":"Comrades","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435450/c4497dbaf970b8b62e0601aeb33a6fc602f10d4f.jpg"},{"name":"Triumph","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435450/5195c7dab227cdd83ecd4499468b5807f11b73dd.jpg"},{"name":"Well Prepared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435450/76d7f155fea17b1deacedb0c8ee05f0858a34ca6.jpg"},{"name":"The Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2435450/957bd02a451ed343d1cc04667326fdc07963b15e.jpg"},{"name":"The Bard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcomm